1790476044373657	seal-aask1l	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-24s7	{"description":"From bn-2otl. seal-core now has anchor::AnchorLocator (unchanged|shifted|modified|deleted|unknown, is_outdated). The CLI review/diff/status/threads show use it, but the TUI (crates/seal-tui) and 'seal threads list' still use stored selection_start against the new target, so after rebase+retarget threads show at the wrong line or as orphans. Use AnchorLocator in both; outdated threads stay visible and marked.","kind":"bug","labels":["retarget"],"size":"s","title":"TUI and threads list place threads by stored line after a rebase"}	blake3:KV_dOPHzSjf0klOdv9l4WsAltjMluBQP8buZPQaCyLU
