1790536266074395	seal-1znock	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-1h2x	{"description":"From bn-24s7. After a rebase + retarget, the TUI renders outdated threads (modified, deleted, unknown) as a plain comment block with no code preview. The CLI 'seal review' shows the code as it was at the thread's own commit for modified/deleted threads (context_source / context_commit in crates/seal-cli/src/cli/commands/reviews.rs). Do the same in the TUI: for modified/deleted threads, load the anchored lines from the thread's commit_hash once at review load (core_client.rs load_review_data, next to locate_threads) and render them as a preview labelled with the short commit. Unknown threads (anchor commit unresolvable) keep the plain block. Never fetch per frame. Tests: TUI mapping-layer unit test with a modified and a deleted thread showing anchor-commit content; mutation-check.","kind":"task","labels":["retarget"],"size":"s","title":"TUI: show code as commented for outdated threads"}	blake3:pdjRDd134tFz01d1hCw_1hSFG2jpnE9I3auAb4ftc5A
